<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πισσο-κοπέω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιττο-</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smear with
				pitch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὀροφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1672.179
				</span></i>
			 :— more freq. in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιττοκοπηθέντα [ξύλα</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.4.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1654.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>have the hair removed by pitch-plasters</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιττοκοπούμενος ἢ ξυρούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					264.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίναιδοι πεπιττοκοπημένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					339
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ -κοπούμενος</span>, title of
			play by Philemon :—hence Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πισσο-κοπία</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
			ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1911.187
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>: Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πισσο-κοπικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πισσο-κόπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.165
			</span></i>.</div>
